{"comment_text": {"ja36:0.1": "", "ja36:0.2": "", "ja36:0.3": "", "ja36:0.4": "", "ja36:1.1": "Noticing a fire starting in the tree under which they shelter, the Bodhisatta tries to warn the flock, but the foolish birds dismissed him, “for he is always seeing crocodiles in a drop of water”. | “Evergreen” (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>jagatirūha</i>, literally “planet-growth”) is a poetic term for a tree. ", "ja36:1.2": "", "ja36:1.3": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vakkaṅga</i>, in Sanskrit variously spelled <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vakrāṅga</i> or <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cakrāṅga</i> is the <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cakravāka</i> or Brahminy goose. It is named for its curved neck. ", "ja36:1.4": "", "ja36:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja36:0.1": "<article id='ja36'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja36:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja36:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja36:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja36:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja36:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja36:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja36:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja36:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja36:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja36:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja36:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja36:0.4": "6. Sakuṇajātaka ", "ja36:1.1": "“Yaṁ nissitā jagatiruhaṁ vihaṅgamā, ", "ja36:1.2": "Svāyaṁ aggiṁ pamuñcati; ", "ja36:1.3": "Disā bhajatha vakkaṅgā, ", "ja36:1.4": "Jātaṁ saraṇato bhayan”ti. ", "ja36:2.1": "Sakuṇajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja36:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 36 ", "ja36:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja36:0.3": "Nests ", "ja36:0.4": "Bird: a past life story ", "ja36:1.1": "You sky-flyers staying near the great evergreen, ", "ja36:1.2": "this fire is emerging! ", "ja36:1.3": "Geese! Flee to the quarters! ", "ja36:1.4": "The threat is born from the refuge! ", "ja36:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja36:0.1": "", "ja36:0.2": "", "ja36:0.3": "", "ja36:0.4": "", "ja36:1.1": "", "ja36:1.2": "", "ja36:1.3": "vakkaṅgā → vaṅkaṅgā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja36:1.4": "", "ja36:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja36:0.1": "", "ja36:0.2": "", "ja36:0.3": "", "ja36:0.4": "", "ja36:1.1": "bj30.16, ms22J_78, msdiv36, pts-vp-pli1.216", "ja36:1.2": "", "ja36:1.3": "", "ja36:1.4": "", "ja36:2.1": "ms22J_79"}, "keys_order": ["ja36:0.1", "ja36:0.2", "ja36:0.3", "ja36:0.4", "ja36:1.1", "ja36:1.2", "ja36:1.3", "ja36:1.4", "ja36:2.1"]}